{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le01ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     What's going on, Sally? You look tired.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I had a rough week. I've almost completed my interviews for the article on friendship. I have a few left. Some stories are so depressing!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Are they? Can you tell me why they're sad?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I spoke to a couple of people who feel lonely all the time. They didn't really have friends growing up, and now they find it hard to socialize.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn7le01ob09re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Don't you think it's hard to live on your own in a big city?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Yeah, I guess. I think there are places where you can meet people, though. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Do you have any suggestions where they could go?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Well, I've always thought that sports were a good way to make friends. I've had meaningful conversations after my yoga or Pilates classes, for example.", "id": 2, "time": "23500"}, {"image": "engenn7le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    I know what you mean, but physical activity isn't for everyone, wouldn't you agree?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I'm not sure I agree with that. You can join classes at any level. You don't have to be a world-class athlete to take up a new sport. I only started getting fit when I started college. I still remember the night I made that decision!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    You've looked gorgeous ever since, dear.", "id": 3, "time": "43000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about social activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about people's past experiences. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for clarification and exchange opinions. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Where would you go to meet new people?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Have you always had a lot of friends? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How many friends did you have when you were in high school?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " What's the easiest way to meet new people?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nSally and Vanessa talk about the daily issues of an average <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">twentysomething</span> in the big city. \n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next 